# ==============================================================================
# Git Ignore Configuration - Feature Class Change Detection Tool
# Only track: .md files, .pyt file, ArcGIS Pro metadata XML files, and QC_Data.gdb
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Ignore everything by default
*

# 2. Allow directory traversal so Git can discover permitted files
!*/

# 3. Track .gitignore itself
!.gitignore

# 4. Include all Markdown documentation files (*.md)
!*.md

# 5. Include Python Toolbox file (*.pyt) at root
!/*.pyt

# 6. Include ArcGIS Pro Tool Metadata XML files at root (essential for tool dialog help)
!GeoChangeDetection.ChangeDetectionTool.pyt.xml
!GeoChangeDetection.pyt.xml
!/*.pyt.xml
!/*.xml

# 7. Include QC_Data.gdb (File Geodatabase)
!QC_Data.gdb/
!QC_Data.gdb/**
!Qc_Data.gdb/
!Qc_Data.gdb/**
!QC_Dara.gdb/
!QC_Dara.gdb/**
!Qc_Dara.gdb/
!Qc_Dara.gdb/**
!test.gdb/
!test.gdb/**

# ==============================================================================
# Exclusions (Lock files, test folders, temporary caches, and system files)
# ==============================================================================
test/
*.lock
*.gdb/*.lock
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.py
*.zip   